  <!-- EN: armor spike -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.label>관통 스파이크</UMW_ArmorSpike.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is reinforced into a heavy armor-piercing spike that punches through plate and carapace. -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.description>끝부분이 판금 갑옷과 외피까지 뚫고 들어가는 무거운 관통 스파이크로 보강돼 있습니다.</UMW_ArmorSpike.description>

  <!-- EN: lancing -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.0>찌르는</UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: armorbane -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.1>갑옷 파괴자의</UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: punching -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.2>뚫는</UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: barbed -->
  <UMW_Barbed.label>미늘</UMW_Barbed.label>

  <!-- EN: Barbs behind the point catch in the wound and tear it wider as the weapon is drawn back out. -->
  <UMW_Barbed.description>끝부분 뒤쪽에 달린 미늘이 상처에 걸려, 무기를 뽑아낼 때 상처를 더 크게 찢어 놓습니다.</UMW_Barbed.description>

