  <!-- EN: cruel -->
  <UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.2>잔혹한</UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: bell-cast -->
  <UMW_BellCast.label>종 주조</UMW_BellCast.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is cast solid like a bell. A clean strike rings through armor and bone, briefly stunning the target. -->
  <UMW_BellCast.description>타격부가 종처럼 한 덩어리로 주조되어 있습니다. 제대로 맞힌 일격은 갑옷과 뼈까지 울려 대상을 잠시 기절시킵니다.</UMW_BellCast.description>

  <!-- EN: bell-cast -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.0>종 주조</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: ringing -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.1>울리는</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: resonant -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.2>공명하는</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: blood-stained -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.label>혈흔</UMW_BloodStained.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is caked in layers of dark, dried blood. The sight of it can send the people it wounds fleeing in panic. Carrying something so grisly weighs on most people, though a few relish it. Traders will pay less for it. -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.description>검게 마른 피가 여러 겹 엉겨 붙어 있습니다. 이 무기에 다친 사람은 그 모습을 보고 겁에 질려 달아날 수 있습니다. 이렇게 끔찍한 물건을 들고 다니면 대부분은 마음이 무거워지지만, 드물게 이를 즐기는 사람도 있습니다. 상인들이 더 낮은 값을 쳐줍니다.</UMW_BloodStained.description>

  <!-- EN: blood-stained -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.0>피에 젖은</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: bloody -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.1>피투성이의</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: gory -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.2>피범벅의</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: sanguine -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.3>검붉은</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: carbonized -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.label>탄화</UMW_Carbonized.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon has been through fire. Its charred surface is hardened by the heat and will not easily burn again. It hits a little harder than normal, but the scorched body is brittle and wears out faster. -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.description>불길을 거친 무기입니다. 열로 단단해진 겉면은 쉽게 다시 타지 않습니다. 보통보다 조금 더 세게 때리지만, 그을린 몸체는 쉽게 부서지고 더 빨리 닳습니다.</UMW_Carbonized.description>

  <!-- EN: carbonized -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.0>탄화된</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: fire-blackened -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.1>불에 검어진</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: charred -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.2>그을린</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: soot-stained -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.3>검댕 묻은</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: counterweighted -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.label>균형추</UMW_Counterweighted.label>

  <!-- EN: A counterweight balances the heft, making the weapon quicker to recover between swings at a slight cost to power. -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.description>균형추가 무게를 잡아 주어 휘두른 뒤 더 빨리 자세를 되찾지만, 위력은 조금 떨어집니다.</UMW_Counterweighted.description>

  <!-- EN: balanced -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.0>균형 잡힌</UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: swift -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.1>재빠른</UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.1>


  <!-- EN: cumbersome -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.label>불편</UMW_Cumbersome.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is unwieldy to use, making it slower to swing. -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.description>다루기 불편해 휘두르는 속도가 느립니다.</UMW_Cumbersome.description>

  <!-- EN: cumbersome -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.0>불편한</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: bulky -->
