  <!-- EN: violet-sheened -->
  <UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.2>보랏빛으로 빛나는</UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: envenomed -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.label>독 도포</UMW_Envenomed.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is coated in a slow neurotoxic venom that poisons those it wounds. -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.description>끝부분에 서서히 퍼지는 신경독이 발려 있어, 상처를 입은 대상을 중독시킵니다.</UMW_Envenomed.description>

