  <!-- EN: This weapon is much lighter than normal, quickening its swing. -->
  <UMW_Lightweight.description>일반적인 무기보다 훨씬 가벼워 휘두르는 속도가 빠릅니다.</UMW_Lightweight.description>

  <!-- EN: light -->
